 ['Higgs field','The electroweak Higgs field has a nonzero vacuum value associated with W and Z masses and fermion Yukawa couplings.'],['Higgs boson','The measured Higgs boson is an excitation associated with the Higgs field, with properties compatible with the Standard Model within tested precision.'],['Higgs potential analogy','A Mexican-hat potential sketches symmetry-breaking minima but is a mathematical analogy rather than an image of the physical vacuum.']
